/**
 * WorkspaceDetailRoute — branch coverage.
 *
 * Covers:
 *  - loading state: renders the loading paragraph
 *  - error state: renders the error alert with back button
 *  - error state with GetTenantError status: shows the status in error text
 *  - loaded state: renders page header with tenant name + tabs
 *  - loaded org (no parent_id): shows the Workspaces tab
 *  - loaded workspace (has parent_id): does NOT show the Workspaces tab
 *  - tab switching: clicking Features tab updates the active tab
 *  - "All workspaces" button navigates to /admin/tenants
 *  - "Manage members" button navigates to /admin/members?workspace=<id>
 *
 * Heavy sub-tabs (WorkspaceSettingsTab, WorkspaceFeaturesTab, OrgWorkspacesTab)
 * are stubbed so we test the route's own branches in isolation.
